<item><title>US sends DR Congo list of agencies receiving over $400 million for Ebola</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/us-sends-dr-congo-list-of-agencies-receiving-over-400-93563e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/us-sends-dr-congo-list-of-agencies-receiving-over-400-93563e/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Washington has handed Kinshasa the names of the agencies that will receive its Ebola response funding, estimated at more than $400 million.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 06:37:25 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/us-sends-dr-congo-list-of-agencies-receiving-over-400-93563e/share.jpg" length="42608" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/us-sends-dr-congo-list-of-agencies-receiving-over-400-93563e/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
