<item><title>Congo Independant columnist warns of verbal excess in DR Congo</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/congo-independant-columnist-warns-of-verbal-excess-in-dr-b90baf/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/congo-independant-columnist-warns-of-verbal-excess-in-dr-b90baf/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>In an opinion column, the writer argues that a flood of public commentary is outpacing analysis and results, and links it to the candidacy of Juliana Amato Lumumba to the OIF.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:39:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
